  "definition": "Non-Completion of the Requirement to Take and Pass the New Hampshire Jurisprudence Assessment Module Described in Phy 402.03",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-02-17",
  "historyNote": "#9456, eff 4-17-09; ss by #10725, eff 11-22-14 (from Phy 402.10); ss by #13825, eff 2-17-24 (formerly Phy 402.10)",
